“表达得足够清楚”？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2918,"promptTokens":155,"completionTokens":222,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:49"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":39,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"e2a5e2f5c7da436f940333cbd347c84a","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009707552306852005,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb3a959efdd2548214c1c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142569308,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb3a959efdd2548214c1c","chatId":"f3b70a46783f4bf190fc20de99d73682","sessionId":null,"userId":129550,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"可能是……我说不舒服的时候，对方会认真停下来听，而不是糊弄过去。还有不用我老猜他什么意思，能让我觉得被当回事。这样想是不是要求太多了？<第19轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":38,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"e2a5e2f5c7da436f940333cbd347c84a","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009707552306852005,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb3a959efdd2548214c1d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142569306,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb3a359efdd2548214bf4","chatId":"f3b70a46783f4bf190fc20de99d73682","sessionId":null,"userId":129550,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你分清了“想念安心”和“认定他”，这本身就不容易。失落很正常，也许你真正想要的是被稳稳接住的感觉。那在你心里，什么样的互动最能让你感到安心呢？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"